   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>为鼓励气候智能型农业，<strong>&ldquo;一亩基金（One Acre Fund）&rdquo;</strong>正为<strong>肯尼亚</strong>、<strong>卢旺达</strong>和<strong>乌干达</strong>的29万农民提供其养家糊口、照明和应对气候变化所需的工具。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
   "links": [],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "“雨林联盟”的黑白青蛙标志。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cf/3a/cf3a3f7ee5fe3f70017d43d0600cfa1c.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/cf/3a/cf3a3f7ee5fe3f70017d43d0600cfa1c.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "settings": null
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-text",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "<p>在<strong>肯尼亚</strong>，<strong>&ldquo;雨林联盟&rdquo;</strong>提倡当地人使用生物燃料，支持节能实践，旨在帮助当地5万农民增加收入，减少碳排放，并为自己的家庭建设更健康的家园。</p>"
   ],
   "images": [],
